<h2>Emacs</h2>
<p>Set up <code>go-mode</code>:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code><span class="p">(</span><span class="nb">use-package</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nv">go-mode</span>
<span class="w">  </span><span class="ss">:ensure</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="no">t</span>
<span class="w">  </span><span class="ss">:hook</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nv">go-mode</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">.</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nv">subword-mode</span><span class="p">)</span>
<span class="w">  </span><span class="ss">:hook</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nv">go-mode</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">.</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">(</span><span class="k">lambda</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nv">eglot-ensure</span><span class="p">))))</span>
</code></pre></div>

<p>Set up <code>dape</code> for debugging:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code><span class="p">(</span><span class="nb">use-package</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nv">dape</span>
<span class="w">  </span><span class="ss">:ensure</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="no">t</span>
<span class="w">  </span><span class="ss">:init</span>
<span class="w">  </span><span class="p">(</span><span class="k">setq</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nv">dape-buffer-window-arrangement</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="ss">&#39;right</span><span class="p">))</span>
</code></pre></div>